@startuml agentic-vs-autonomous-offering
title Agentic vs Autonomous Offering Orthogonality ; per ADR-ES-019 section 13

skinparam monochrome true
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultTextAlignment center

class "Offering" as O
class "Agentic Offering" as AgO
class "Autonomous Offering" as AutoO
class "Agentic + Autonomous Offering" as BothO

O <|-- AgO : specializes (v1.7.0)
O <|-- AutoO : specializes (v1.8.0)
AgO ..> BothO : compositional future
AutoO ..> BothO : compositional future

note bottom of O
  Per ADR-ES-019 section 13 + CR-ES-019 section 12:
  - Autonomous Offering does NOT imply Agentic Offering
  - Agentic Offering does NOT imply Autonomous Offering
  - An Offering may be both
  - An Offering may be neither
  - The combined state is NOT a new foundational type
end note

@enduml
